• Urgency colour scale and one-week pressure gauge
• Android home-screen widget for the next deadline
• Samsung Notes share import and "Paste a note"
• Daily digest notification
• Light/dark/system appearance
• Optional sync settings and privacy policy
• About page with app version and the company website (teto.co.ke); the
  "Powered by teto technologies" footer is tappable everywhere, including the
  loading screen, and opens teto.co.ke in the browser. Added 18 Nov 2026 in
  1.0.21+22 via the existing platform channel (no new dependency).
